London, so a few days ago,

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:16.300
I injured myself.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.860
- Oh I'm surprised.
(Link chuckles)

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:21.327
- I just thought I
would share it with you,

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:26.110
loyal Ear Biscuit
listener, and to you Rhett,

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:29.190
loyal friend and irritable companion.

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:30.740
- Yep.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:34.980
- So I get home and I happen
to mention to Christy,

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:39.020
I was like I'm gonna put my passport away.

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.390
I'm gonna put it back in the safe.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.830
I keep my passport in our fireproof safe,

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:46.918
