think if there was a fire,

00:07:46.918 --> 00:07:49.720
I guess we'd grab the
safe but if we didn't,

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:52.980
maybe it would survive, but I don't know.

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:54.540
It's like--
- It's fireproof, man.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:55.373
- It's fireproof

00:07:55.373 --> 00:07:57.240
