- Why you gotta grab it?

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.870
- That's true, I wouldn't
grab it, it's heavy.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.547
It's a lot of things as I'll get into,

00:08:01.547 --> 00:08:03.380
