00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:04.380
because I haven't put mine back in there.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.430
I was like well we need
to keep 'em in there.

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:08.600
- Yeah yeah.
- So I go get hers,

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:12.140
