00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:38.220
Isn't it?

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.850
- My safe can't fit under my bed, bro.

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.810
- You got a big safe?

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:43.950
- Yeah.
- Like how big

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.403
is your dummy safe?

00:08:46.813 --> 00:08:49.130
I've seen your dummy
safe, it's like you walk

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:49.963
in the front door

00:08:49.963 --> 00:08:50.817
