- You could carry it.

00:08:50.817 --> 00:08:53.313
But the real safe I can get into.

00:08:53.313 --> 00:08:54.220
- What?

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:55.340
- I've never told you about it.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.500
- The dummy safe is in
the front of your house

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:58.495
just sittin' there.

00:08:58.495 --> 00:09:01.546
A thief walks in, you're
like dummy safe here.

00:09:01.546 --> 00:09:03.860
Wocka wocka wock--
- It says take me.

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:04.693
- I'm dummy.

00:09:04.693 --> 00:09:06.780
I'm not a dummy safe.
- It says free.

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:09.120
- You have a walk-in safe?

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:09.953
- I might.

00:09:09.953 --> 00:09:11.140
Let's talk about you gettin' hurt.

00:09:11.140 --> 00:09:13.690
- Ironically a walk-in safe is not safe.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:14.990
'Cause you can get locked in it.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:17.170
- Well I'm not plannin'
on locking myself in.

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:19.610
- My safe is pretty
small, it's like the size

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:23.668
