stacked on top of each other.

00:09:23.668 --> 00:09:25.430
It's got a lid on it.

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:29.350
Anyway, it's not in the
place that it used to be

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:34.050
and neither is Jade's dog kennel.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.513
Jade is here with me today.

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:38.470
Jade, say hello.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:39.513
Jade, say hello.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:44.080
I'm tellin' a story about
your kennel, your cage.

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:46.953
I don't like to call it a
cage because it's her home

00:09:46.953 --> 00:09:49.240
when we're not at home and she likes it.

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:51.050
It makes her feel secure to go in there,

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:54.480
and more importantly she
doesn't pee or poop in it.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:58.050
