00:10:03.590 --> 00:10:05.173
that likes to sneak and pee.

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:09.090
Anyway, when Britton moved into our house,

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:14.010
we converted the office into his bedroom.

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:14.843
- Right.

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:17.913
