00:10:17.913 --> 00:10:20.756
Anyway, that's where we kept her kennel

00:10:20.756 --> 00:10:23.950
and where I also kept the
safe and I kept the printer.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:25.440
So then I'm like, I gotta find a new place

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:26.680
to put our printer.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.270
I moved all of that stuff
that's in that bigger room

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:32.647
