00:57:34.269 --> 00:57:37.600
- Now John Mayer
commented on Jimmy's post.

00:57:37.600 --> 00:57:38.930
I comment on Jimmy's post.

00:57:38.930 --> 00:57:42.440
At this point in time, he's
