01:00:41.902 --> 01:00:43.630
I mean look, I got a hoodie on.

01:00:43.630 --> 01:00:46.293
You know, I'm ready to be
athletic at the drop of a hat.

01:00:46.293 --> 01:00:49.300
- Is this a Ariana Grande type thing?

01:00:49.300 --> 01:00:52.545
I think, you know with the
ponytail and the athletic wear.

01:00:52.545 --> 01:00:53.960
She'll do that.

01:00:53.960 --> 01:00:57.700
- Is that happening in
this country as well?

01:00:57.700 --> 01:01:00.730
- Probably yeah.
- It's not something that I'm,

01:01:00.730 --> 01:01:03.013
I don't observe the young people anymore.

01:01:03.013 --> 01:01:04.280
I just look over them.

01:01:04.280 --> 01:01:05.960
- You look through your own kids, right?

01:01:05.960 --> 01:01:08.760
- Right, I have noticed
that our kids are doing

01:01:08.760 --> 01:01:12.704
the athletic wear thing but it's a--

01:01:12.704 --> 01:01:16.750
- But they take it to
another level and it's like,

01:01:16.750 --> 01:01:20.270
it's like if your backup dancers were all

01:01:20.270 --> 01:01:22.973
wearing athletic wear,
you know it's like that,

01:01:22.973 --> 01:01:24.590
it's a heightened type thing.

01:01:24.590 --> 01:01:25.773
It's heightened.

01:01:25.773 --> 01:01:27.250
- Yeah.
- And then you get,

01:01:27.250 --> 01:01:29.500
you're on an elevator and
then the doors are closing,

01:01:29.500 --> 01:01:31.604
all of a sudden it's like, oy, oy, oy!

01:01:31.604 --> 01:01:34.070
And then all of a sudden
the elevators open back up

01:01:34.070 --> 01:01:36.520
and all these people
pour in and they're like,

01:01:36.520 --> 01:01:39.020
they're very excited about themselves.

01:01:39.020 --> 01:01:40.408
- Oh well--
- That's how I feel.

01:01:40.408 --> 01:01:41.600
- Okay.

01:01:41.600 --> 01:01:42.907
Yeah.
- I just felt like

01:01:42.907 --> 01:01:44.640
I was on an elevator
with a bunch of people

01:01:44.640 --> 01:01:45.870
very excited about themselves.

01:01:45.870 --> 01:01:47.615
Now we're different.

01:01:47.615 --> 01:01:50.710
We're just very picky and demanding.

01:01:50.710 --> 01:01:55.710
And crotchety and can fill
reams of audio with complaints.

01:01:58.160 --> 01:02:03.150
- I'm not complaining about
the extremely, you know--

01:02:03.150 --> 01:02:04.440
- They seem happier than us.

01:02:04.440 --> 01:02:05.610
