- I'm just saying.

01:02:05.610 --> 01:02:08.700
- Athletic teens.
- A lot happier than us.

01:02:08.700 --> 01:02:10.820
- But I just made an observation.

01:02:10.820 --> 01:02:15.070
I felt like I was like, I
had fast forwarded to some,

01:02:15.070 --> 01:02:18.150
