by the special train

01:02:29.351 --> 01:02:31.310
that grabs you by your hair.

01:02:31.310 --> 01:02:32.598
You know what I'm saying, it's like,

01:02:32.598 --> 01:02:35.360
that would begin to make sense to me.

01:02:35.360 --> 01:02:38.580
But it's so, everybody looked the same.

01:02:38.580 --> 01:02:40.840
It was very uniform, it was
like this is our uniform.

01:02:40.840 --> 01:02:42.453
We are British vloggers.

01:02:42.453 --> 01:02:44.297
- Again, it's probably
not a British thing.

01:02:44.297 --> 01:02:46.620
- You think it's just people of that age.

01:02:46.620 --> 01:02:47.470
- Yeah.
- On the internet.

01:02:47.470 --> 01:02:48.893
- Yes, yes, yes.

01:02:49.840 --> 01:02:50.750
- Okay.

01:02:50.750 --> 01:02:53.330
We are people on the internet now.

01:02:53.330 --> 01:02:55.190
- I love the humor.

01:02:55.190 --> 01:02:56.780
Let's not forget that.

01:02:56.780 --> 01:02:58.820
We made a video with
TomSka and in the middle

01:02:58.820 --> 01:03:03.070
